  "notes": [
    "A05 recovery of A04: Balarama Jayanti (Bhadrapada Shukla Shashthi) is not Hal Shashthi (Krishna Shashthi); Kannada/Telugu Hanuman Jayanti follow other rules than the Tamil Margazhi Amavasya the engine encodes; Pitru Paksha compares its first day (Purnima Shraddha); Kali Chaudas is the nishita variant of Naraka Chaturdashi.",
    "Magha Amavasya is a separate Drik entry (Amanta Magha) and is not Mauni Amavasya (Purnimanta Magha Krishna = Amanta Pausha Amavasya)."
  ]
